comment0.text=\r\n Models the operation of an Electric Bike (EB) Company. \r\n It manages a fleet of {@link ElectricBike}s and a network of {@link BikeStation}s.\r\n * @author David J. Barnes and Michael K\u00F6lling\r\n @author DP classes\r\n @version 2026.10.13\r\n
